Realignment Workflow

1. Identify surplus cash.
2. Identify liquidity-deficit accounts.
3. Calculate required transfer amount.
4. Identify eligible source and destination accounts.
5. Generate realignment proposal.
6. Validate account status and currency.
7. Validate transfer limits.
8. Calculate applicable FX conversion.
9. Generate funding instructions.
10. Submit for approval.
11. Execute or simulate the transfer.
12. Receive bank confirmation.
13. Update cash positions.
14. Generate accounting entries.
15. Reconcile the transfer.
16. Close the realignment request.

