11. Free Cash Management

Create a dedicated Free Cash Management module.

Free cash represents available liquidity after considering operational requirements, restrictions, funding obligations, and minimum liquidity reserves.

Free Cash Calculation

Free Cash = Eligible Available Cash - Minimum Operational Cash - Restricted Cash - Required Funding Reserves

Make the formula configurable by entity, account, currency, and liquidity policy.

